      "description": "Existing resource-category destinations and source/license reminder in a floating white card.",
      "html": "<aside class=\"ds-rail\"><h3>创作时用得上的</h3><p>让资源就在手边。</p><nav aria-label=\"资源\"><a href=\"/resources?type=designs\">UI 设计<small>界面与交互参考</small></a><a href=\"/resources?type=skills\">AI Skill<small>可复用的工作方法</small></a><a href=\"/resources?type=docs\">文档<small>知识与使用说明</small></a><a href=\"/resources?type=resources\">网站与工具<small>解决手头的小问题</small></a></nav><p class=\"ds-note\">打开详情，查看原始来源和使用许可。</p></aside>",
